    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Songs of the Hmong is a children's book illustration style puzzle game.</h2><br>The game follows the adventure of a Hmong girl as she searches for the seed of the sacred tree in the forest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/a158ed879a0434e5af29284246cde682.poster.avif?t=1738910135\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/a158ed879a0434e5af29284246cde682.webm?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/a158ed879a0434e5af29284246cde682.mp4?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players will explore stories related to ancient Hmong literary works in a simple and cute paper-folded world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/872e506e979fa6b093193ea48f3c03c2.poster.avif?t=1738910135\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/872e506e979fa6b093193ea48f3c03c2.webm?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/872e506e979fa6b093193ea48f3c03c2.mp4?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The music tracks available in the game are all adapted from ancient Hmong melodies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/fec995a7518e251669cbc1b2ec89217e.poster.avif?t=1738910135\" width=600 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/fec995a7518e251669cbc1b2ec89217e.webm?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/fec995a7518e251669cbc1b2ec89217e.mp4?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Songs of the Hmong is a children's book illustration style puzzle game.</h2><br>The game follows the adventure of a Hmong girl as she searches for the seed of the sacred tree in the forest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/a158ed879a0434e5af29284246cde682.poster.avif?t=1738910135\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/a158ed879a0434e5af29284246cde682.webm?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/a158ed879a0434e5af29284246cde682.mp4?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players will explore stories related to ancient Hmong literary works in a simple and cute paper-folded world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/872e506e979fa6b093193ea48f3c03c2.poster.avif?t=1738910135\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/872e506e979fa6b093193ea48f3c03c2.webm?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/872e506e979fa6b093193ea48f3c03c2.mp4?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The music tracks available in the game are all adapted from ancient Hmong melodies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/fec995a7518e251669cbc1b2ec89217e.poster.avif?t=1738910135\" width=600 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/fec995a7518e251669cbc1b2ec89217e.webm?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715930/extras/fec995a7518e251669cbc1b2ec89217e.mp4?t=1738910135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "A Hmong girl named Xiaomiao meets a mysterious old man in the forest who has lost his memory. The old man tells Xiaomiao that to restore world order, she needs to find the seed of the Sacred Tree. Can Xiaomiao, with the power of music, successfully find the seed of the sacred tree?",
